      "headline": "The Gold pipeline resolves the only quality issues found in WESAD. Conformance and plausibility violations fall from 60 to 0 after cleaning the E4 TEMP warm-up artefact. Completeness after cleaning: unintentional missingness = 0.0 (60 intentional removals reported separately). Cross-modal alignment passes the 1.0 s threshold (max residual 0.107 s; timeliness partly assessed: the check cannot detect uniform start-time shifts). All four measured dimensions pass. The framework demonstrates end-to-end detection, documentation, and resolution of a real quality issue."
    },
