      "threshold_pass_bronze": null,
      "threshold_pass_gold": true,
      "limitation": "Partly assessed. The 5-point reconstruction method verifies internal consistency within the overlap window but cannot detect a uniform start-time shift applied to both devices simultaneously. Fault injection confirmed that shifts of 0.5 s to 3600 s all went undetected."
